1
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,940
=When the Lights Rise=
=Episode 8=

2
00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:11,900
Miss Mei.

3
00:01:12,960 --> 00:01:13,620
Madam.

4
00:01:14,340 --> 00:01:16,620
Isn't Xiaozhu's funeral today?

5
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:17,500
No.

6
00:01:17,740 --> 00:01:20,940
Oh, where are you going so early?

7
00:01:21,260 --> 00:01:22,660
To someone else's funeral.

8
00:01:22,940 --> 00:01:23,700
Extra!

9
00:01:23,700 --> 00:01:26,460
Tobacco tycoon Kuang Jinpeng is set
to welcome his illegitimate son home.

10
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:27,260
Extra!

11
00:01:27,260 --> 00:01:28,620
Tobacco tycoon Kuang Jinpeng...

12
00:01:28,940 --> 00:01:29,820
I'll take one.

13
00:01:30,320 --> 00:01:31,240
(Mr. Ding Zhao)

14
00:01:33,900 --> 00:01:34,820
Deliver this letter

15
00:01:34,820 --> 00:01:37,260
to the Ding residence
at Sanshi Club in Nanshi District.

16
00:01:39,020 --> 00:01:41,220
Oh, look at her.

17
00:01:41,220 --> 00:01:42,660
Still spending money so freely.

18
00:01:43,220 --> 00:01:45,980
I wonder if she'll even be able
to pay the rent on time.

19
00:01:52,740 --> 00:01:53,700
Have you found her?

20
00:01:55,140 --> 00:01:56,100
How can you search

21
00:01:56,100 --> 00:01:57,700
all of Shanghai by yourself?

22
00:01:58,460 --> 00:02:00,380
Here, have a fried dough stick.

23
00:02:00,420 --> 00:02:01,220
It's still warm.

24
00:02:02,140 --> 00:02:03,140
Once you've finished eating,

25
00:02:03,140 --> 00:02:04,300
get some rest.

26
00:02:04,300 --> 00:02:05,260
I'll report it to the police.

27
00:02:05,420 --> 00:02:06,460
What good would that do?

28
00:02:06,620 --> 00:02:07,620
Would they even care?

29
00:02:09,060 --> 00:02:10,180
Is Mr. Ding here?

30
00:02:10,740 --> 00:02:12,020
Which Mr. Ding are you looking for?

31
00:02:12,020 --> 00:02:14,560
(To Mr. Ding Zhao)
The Mr. Ding named on this envelope.

32
00:02:14,620 --> 00:02:15,700
I don't know him.

33
00:02:15,900 --> 00:02:16,700
Thank you.

34
00:02:25,020 --> 00:02:26,100
What does it say?

35
00:02:26,160 --> 00:02:27,760
(Xiaozhu was forced
by Lv Mengde to drink coca wine.)

36
00:02:27,760 --> 00:02:29,160
(We must get justice
for Xiaozhu, no matter what.)

37
00:02:32,220 --> 00:02:33,020
Hey!

38
00:02:33,020 --> 00:02:34,100
Where are you going?

39
00:02:42,100 --> 00:02:42,980
This is the place.

40
00:03:01,300 --> 00:03:02,940
Miss, please show your invitation.

41
00:03:03,020 --> 00:03:03,820
I don't have one.

42
00:03:04,420 --> 00:03:05,660
You can't enter without an invitation.

43
00:03:09,060 --> 00:03:09,980
I'm not going inside.

44
00:03:10,620 --> 00:03:12,900
Just inform your eldest young lady

45
00:03:12,900 --> 00:03:14,980
that Mei Yuhe is waiting
for her at the entrance.

46
00:03:15,140 --> 00:03:15,940
Well...

47
00:03:16,740 --> 00:03:17,700
Let her in.

48
00:03:19,020 --> 00:03:19,820
Young Master.

49
00:03:20,260 --> 00:03:21,140
Young Master Kuang.

50
00:03:21,500 --> 00:03:23,020
How could we let Miss Mei's

51
00:03:23,660 --> 00:03:24,660
kindness go unappreciated?

52
00:03:39,820 --> 00:03:41,580
I didn't expect you to come.

53
00:03:42,100 --> 00:03:43,420
Since this is a farewell banquet,

54
00:03:43,660 --> 00:03:45,500
the deceased deserves some justice.

55
00:03:45,660 --> 00:03:46,500
Don't you agree?

56
00:03:48,340 --> 00:03:49,020
Young Master.

57
00:03:49,020 --> 00:03:50,220
A guest has arrived inside.

58
00:03:50,220 --> 00:03:51,660
The master wants you to come in.

59
00:03:54,700 --> 00:03:56,740
Then I'll be waiting to see
how you settle this, Miss Mei.

60
00:04:13,940 --> 00:04:14,700
Boss.

61
00:04:14,700 --> 00:04:16,100
Why are we rushing
so early in the morning?

62
00:04:16,100 --> 00:04:16,818
(Xiaozhu was only sixteen.)
Are you headed to a funeral or a wedding?

63
00:04:16,818 --> 00:04:17,580
(She must have been terrified.)
Are you headed to a funeral or a wedding?

64
00:04:20,020 --> 00:04:20,860
(Mei Yuhe.)

65
00:04:21,900 --> 00:04:23,780
(Do you really have no regard
for your own life?)

66
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:37,580
Isn't she the one always
flattering Kuang Yinyue?

67
00:04:37,960 --> 00:04:39,740
That tailor from the dress shop.

68
00:04:40,190 --> 00:04:41,670
That's her?

69
00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:44,020
What's she doing here?

70
00:04:44,340 --> 00:04:46,860
The girl who died
at the Paris Hotel was her sister.

71
00:04:47,310 --> 00:04:50,100
I heard Kuang Yinyue even went there
to cause trouble.

72
00:04:50,500 --> 00:04:52,500
Goodness, she's certainly bold.

73
00:04:52,500 --> 00:04:54,130
How dare she show up after all that?

74
00:04:54,260 --> 00:04:55,140
Here she comes.

75
00:05:00,220 --> 00:05:01,020
Mei Yuhe?

76
00:05:03,740 --> 00:05:06,020
Mrs. Kuang, my condolences.

77
00:05:06,020 --> 00:05:07,140
What are you doing here?

78
00:05:07,220 --> 00:05:08,260
How dare you come here?

79
00:05:09,020 --> 00:05:10,340
I'm here to help you get revenge.

80
00:05:11,540 --> 00:05:12,820
What are you plotting this time?

81
00:05:13,460 --> 00:05:15,540
The person truly responsible
for Dong Zhenglun's death

82
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:17,680
is right here.

83
00:05:22,300 --> 00:05:23,580
Once this is over,

84
00:05:24,220 --> 00:05:25,980
I'll give you the answers
you deserve, Madam.

85
00:05:29,420 --> 00:05:30,820
If you dare cause trouble here,

86
00:05:31,140 --> 00:05:32,290
I won't let you get away with it.

87
00:05:33,860 --> 00:05:34,780
I've told you.

88
00:05:35,420 --> 00:05:36,660
I'm here to help you.

89
00:05:37,860 --> 00:05:39,060
Please rest assured, Madam.

90
00:06:04,260 --> 00:06:06,390
Master, it's almost time.

91
00:06:12,100 --> 00:06:12,900
Mengde.

92
00:06:13,020 --> 00:06:15,900
Go invite Boss Ren and Mr. Yoshida over.

93
00:06:22,260 --> 00:06:23,180
Mr. Yoshida.

94
00:06:23,760 --> 00:06:24,880
This way, please.

95
00:06:26,820 --> 00:06:27,500
Father.

96
00:06:27,500 --> 00:06:28,460
Let's go too.

97
00:06:41,900 --> 00:06:42,500
What are you doing?

98
00:06:47,300 --> 00:06:48,100
Everyone.

99
00:06:48,620 --> 00:06:50,100
Today's farewell banquet

100
00:06:50,460 --> 00:06:52,380
has been made possible

101
00:06:53,140 --> 00:06:55,300
with the generous support
of the Kun Society and Boss Ren,

102
00:06:55,700 --> 00:06:57,620
allowing us to arrange everything

103
00:06:57,620 --> 00:06:59,180
in just a few days.

104
00:06:59,420 --> 00:07:01,900
The Kuang family extends
its sincere thanks.

105
00:07:04,900 --> 00:07:08,980
My son-in-law, Dong Zhenglun,
was a kind man,

106
00:07:09,620 --> 00:07:10,820
gentle and refined.

107
00:07:11,220 --> 00:07:13,020
Sadly, he was struck by a sudden illness

108
00:07:13,660 --> 00:07:14,940
and passed away far too young.

109
00:07:15,460 --> 00:07:17,180
It is truly a great loss.

110
00:07:17,700 --> 00:07:20,900
Zhenglun also appreciated
the finer things in life

111
00:07:21,060 --> 00:07:22,620
and disliked noise and commotion.

112
00:07:22,860 --> 00:07:25,380
That is why the Kuang family
has arranged

113
00:07:25,380 --> 00:07:26,900
this special farewell banquet

114
00:07:27,180 --> 00:07:30,260
so we can remember him in our hearts.

115
00:07:33,220 --> 00:07:34,020
Everyone,

116
00:07:34,860 --> 00:07:39,260
please raise your glasses of champagne

117
00:07:39,540 --> 00:07:42,580
and join us in bidding Zhenglun
a final farewell.

118
00:07:42,780 --> 00:07:43,580
Please.

119
00:08:19,900 --> 00:08:21,220
Yuhe, watch out!

120
00:08:25,020 --> 00:08:26,020
Where are those gunshots coming from?

121
00:08:28,100 --> 00:08:28,860
Guards!

122
00:08:28,860 --> 00:08:29,820
Seize them!

123
00:08:29,860 --> 00:08:31,060
Seal off all the exits.

124
00:08:31,260 --> 00:08:32,420
- Find whoever fired the gun.
- Let go!

125
00:08:32,420 --> 00:08:33,180
Don't touch me!

126
00:08:36,220 --> 00:08:36,900
What are you doing here?

127
00:08:37,300 --> 00:08:38,140
What do you think?

128
00:08:39,660 --> 00:08:40,470
Are you all right?

129
00:08:40,470 --> 00:08:41,210
I'm fine.

130
00:08:42,620 --> 00:08:44,100
Mengde, are you all right?

131
00:08:45,700 --> 00:08:47,420
Thank you, Mr. Jing.

132
00:08:50,100 --> 00:08:50,940
Who are you?

133
00:08:50,980 --> 00:08:51,900
What are you trying to do?

134
00:08:53,020 --> 00:08:53,820
Let go of me!

135
00:09:00,750 --> 00:09:02,390
Today is Mr. Dong's farewell banquet.

136
00:09:02,740 --> 00:09:04,220
Why are you causing trouble, Miss Mei?

137
00:09:11,140 --> 00:09:13,740
Dong Zhenglun didn't die of illness.

138
00:09:14,220 --> 00:09:15,180
He was killed by my sister,

139
00:09:15,620 --> 00:09:17,820
a victim of his assault.

140
00:09:18,620 --> 00:09:19,500
Dong Zhenglun

141
00:09:19,660 --> 00:09:20,540
was a monster hiding behind
a respectable facade.

142
00:09:20,540 --> 00:09:21,700
He brought it upon himself.

143
00:09:21,820 --> 00:09:24,060
His death deserves no commemoration.

144
00:09:25,620 --> 00:09:26,420
Miss Mei.

145
00:09:26,820 --> 00:09:28,020
Do you have any evidence?

146
00:09:28,020 --> 00:09:29,500
I was there when it happened.

147
00:09:31,940 --> 00:09:32,740
Madam.

148
00:09:33,020 --> 00:09:33,940
Didn't you ask me

149
00:09:33,940 --> 00:09:35,780
why I left halfway through?

150
00:09:35,940 --> 00:09:37,500
Because I saw my sister

151
00:09:38,300 --> 00:09:39,700
and followed her.

152
00:09:40,460 --> 00:09:42,180
You saw everything?

153
00:09:43,020 --> 00:09:44,020
That's absurd!

154
00:09:44,340 --> 00:09:46,300
Just because you say
you were there doesn't make it true.

155
00:09:48,020 --> 00:09:50,940
Dong Zhenglun was wearing
a white suit when he died.

156
00:09:51,020 --> 00:09:51,900
On his back,

157
00:09:51,900 --> 00:09:53,820
there was a fatal stab wound
straight to the heart,

158
00:09:53,820 --> 00:09:54,980
along with many other stab wounds.

159
00:09:55,220 --> 00:09:56,740
How could I know so many details

160
00:09:57,020 --> 00:09:58,220
that were never made public

161
00:09:58,220 --> 00:09:59,340
unless I'd seen them myself?

162
00:10:08,940 --> 00:10:11,500
My sister used this very dagger

163
00:10:11,500 --> 00:10:12,900
to kill Dong Zhenglun!

164
00:10:17,020 --> 00:10:17,820
Father.

165
00:10:20,620 --> 00:10:21,420
Miss Mei.

166
00:10:21,820 --> 00:10:23,100
Even if that's true,

167
00:10:23,860 --> 00:10:25,500
why did you try to kill Boss Lv?

168
00:10:26,340 --> 00:10:27,980
What does he have to do with this?

169
00:10:29,860 --> 00:10:30,540
Because

170
00:10:31,580 --> 00:10:33,820
the one behind all of this

171
00:10:34,300 --> 00:10:34,940
is him,

172
00:10:35,060 --> 00:10:35,940
Lv Mengde!

173
00:10:43,940 --> 00:10:45,060
I had no idea

174
00:10:45,820 --> 00:10:47,020
I was the director of this whole drama.

175
00:10:47,420 --> 00:10:50,660
The invitation Xiaozhu used
to enter the Paris Hotel was yours.

176
00:10:51,460 --> 00:10:53,060
So what if it was mine?

177
00:10:53,940 --> 00:10:56,260
How do you know she didn't steal it?

178
00:10:56,490 --> 00:10:57,780
The coca wine she drank

179
00:10:58,100 --> 00:10:59,660
was smuggled into Shanghai by you.

180
00:10:59,660 --> 00:11:01,580
She even cut her hair short for you.

181
00:11:02,020 --> 00:11:04,060
And Lisa, the star singer
at your dance hall,

182
00:11:04,260 --> 00:11:05,420
tried to kill me repeatedly.

183
00:11:06,620 --> 00:11:07,780
Most importantly,

184
00:11:09,060 --> 00:11:10,220
you stood to gain the most

185
00:11:11,020 --> 00:11:13,540
from Dong Zhenglun's death.

186
00:11:14,620 --> 00:11:16,220
With so many clues pointing to you,

187
00:11:16,220 --> 00:11:17,820
how can you still claim
you had nothing to do with it?

188
00:11:21,420 --> 00:11:22,620
What you're saying is interesting,

189
00:11:23,020 --> 00:11:24,540
but it's all speculation.

190
00:11:26,070 --> 00:11:27,990
What about the Black Cat list
in black and white?

191
00:11:29,220 --> 00:11:30,660
Right after Xiaozhu's name

192
00:11:30,700 --> 00:11:32,460
were the three characters Dong Zhenglun.

193
00:11:33,220 --> 00:11:35,140
Was someone predicting the future?

194
00:11:40,860 --> 00:11:42,740
That list is in my bag.

195
00:11:52,820 --> 00:11:53,620
Father.

196
00:12:01,660 --> 00:12:02,460
Boss Kuang.

197
00:12:03,820 --> 00:12:05,940
This really does look
like your son's handwriting.

198
00:12:11,640 --> 00:12:12,640
(Lisa, Kong Shun,
Mei Xiaozhu, Dong Zhenglun)

199
00:12:12,640 --> 00:12:13,960
(Dong Zhenglun)

200
00:12:16,260 --> 00:12:17,260
Grandfather, are you all right?

201
00:12:19,500 --> 00:12:20,300
Lv Mengde!

202
00:12:20,820 --> 00:12:21,740
You monster!

203
00:12:21,740 --> 00:12:23,100
How dare you send women to him?

204
00:12:23,100 --> 00:12:23,860
Sister!

205
00:12:32,900 --> 00:12:34,900
This is all a scheme to frame me.

206
00:12:35,020 --> 00:12:36,700
Of course she had to make it convincing.

207
00:12:42,420 --> 00:12:43,260
Gentlemen.

208
00:12:44,020 --> 00:12:46,420
Your names are on the list.

209
00:12:46,700 --> 00:12:47,780
Why don't you tell everyone?

210
00:12:48,660 --> 00:12:50,300
Have I ever sent you women?

211
00:12:57,220 --> 00:12:57,850
You...

212
00:13:05,020 --> 00:13:05,780
Fanshu.

213
00:13:06,740 --> 00:13:07,540
What do you think?

214
00:13:13,660 --> 00:13:14,900
This matter involves many people.

215
00:13:15,100 --> 00:13:16,500
I think we should investigate further.

216
00:13:16,500 --> 00:13:17,260
Enough!

217
00:13:19,420 --> 00:13:21,620
Just because the Kuang family
isn't as powerful as it once was,

218
00:13:21,620 --> 00:13:23,420
you think you can
look down on me, Kuang Jinpeng?

219
00:13:23,420 --> 00:13:24,340
Does that mean any nobody

220
00:13:24,340 --> 00:13:26,140
can trample all over my family?

221
00:13:26,620 --> 00:13:27,420
Boss Kuang.

222
00:13:27,420 --> 00:13:28,300
Please calm down.

223
00:13:28,500 --> 00:13:29,940
Everything we've done is
for the Kun Society.

224
00:13:34,340 --> 00:13:35,140
Boss Ren.

225
00:13:35,660 --> 00:13:37,220
I appreciate the Kun Society's concern.

226
00:13:37,740 --> 00:13:40,620
But the man who died was my son-in-law,

227
00:13:41,420 --> 00:13:43,100
and the one now being falsely accused

228
00:13:43,100 --> 00:13:44,260
is my son.

229
00:13:44,420 --> 00:13:47,580
This concerns
the Kuang family's reputation.

230
00:13:47,820 --> 00:13:49,660
Let us handle it ourselves.

231
00:13:49,780 --> 00:13:50,500
Father!

232
00:13:50,500 --> 00:13:51,340
Say no more!

233
00:13:57,460 --> 00:13:58,340
As for you,

234
00:14:01,820 --> 00:14:03,140
that sister of yours

235
00:14:03,620 --> 00:14:05,220
was greedy for wealth and status.

236
00:14:05,620 --> 00:14:06,860
She tried to get close to the powerful.

237
00:14:07,100 --> 00:14:08,420
When she couldn't win over my son,

238
00:14:08,540 --> 00:14:10,460
she went after my son-in-law instead.

239
00:14:10,900 --> 00:14:12,460
And it cost her life.

240
00:14:12,540 --> 00:14:13,980
She got what she deserved!

241
00:14:16,030 --> 00:14:16,410
You...

242
00:14:17,460 --> 00:14:17,740
You...

243
00:14:17,860 --> 00:14:18,580
Let go of me!

244
00:14:20,520 --> 00:14:20,930
I...

245
00:14:22,220 --> 00:14:23,020
You're asking for trouble!

246
00:14:24,340 --> 00:14:25,460
Are you all rebelling against me?

247
00:14:26,820 --> 00:14:27,340
Boss Lv.

248
00:14:27,660 --> 00:14:28,540
Think carefully.

249
00:14:28,580 --> 00:14:29,380
Enough.

250
00:14:32,020 --> 00:14:33,020
Mr. Yoshida.

251
00:14:33,740 --> 00:14:34,860
I'm sorry you had to witness this.

252
00:14:35,780 --> 00:14:36,580
Not at all.

253
00:14:40,660 --> 00:14:41,460
Let go!

254
00:14:48,300 --> 00:14:49,180
Miss Mei.

255
00:14:49,740 --> 00:14:51,580
You are a very brave woman.

256
00:14:52,100 --> 00:14:54,460
You've left quite an impression on me.

257
00:15:04,460 --> 00:15:05,540
I'm an outsider.

258
00:15:05,840 --> 00:15:08,620
Normally, I shouldn't interfere
in the Kun Society's affairs.

259
00:15:09,460 --> 00:15:13,540
But I admire Miss Mei's courage.

260
00:15:14,300 --> 00:15:17,900
Why not do me a favor today

261
00:15:18,900 --> 00:15:22,340
and let me mediate this dispute?

262
00:15:25,570 --> 00:15:25,980
Very well.

263
00:15:26,540 --> 00:15:29,100
If Mr. Yoshida can ensure
justice is served,

264
00:15:29,260 --> 00:15:31,940
(In Loving Memory)
the Kun Society would be honored.

265
00:15:32,460 --> 00:15:33,260
Boss Kuang.

266
00:15:34,460 --> 00:15:35,420
What do you think?

267
00:15:40,420 --> 00:15:41,220
All right.

268
00:15:41,460 --> 00:15:44,500
We'll leave it to Mr. Yoshida.

269
00:15:47,220 --> 00:15:48,060
Miss Mei.

270
00:15:48,460 --> 00:15:50,220
Has your sister's funeral been held?

271
00:15:51,260 --> 00:15:52,100
Not yet.

272
00:15:52,820 --> 00:15:53,860
Then here's what I propose.

273
00:15:54,540 --> 00:15:55,420
I'll cover the expenses

274
00:15:55,940 --> 00:15:58,500
for a funeral at a church
in the city center.

275
00:15:58,740 --> 00:16:01,620
We'll give her a proper farewell.

276
00:16:01,900 --> 00:16:05,420
That should also settle the dispute
between you and the Kuang family.

277
00:16:06,540 --> 00:16:07,340
What do you say?

278
00:16:13,540 --> 00:16:14,340
There's no need.

279
00:16:15,140 --> 00:16:16,340
As for my sister's funeral,

280
00:16:16,340 --> 00:16:17,540
I'll arrange it myself.

281
00:16:22,740 --> 00:16:25,460
Miss Mei, you should accept this offer.

282
00:16:37,340 --> 00:16:38,140
Miss Mei.

283
00:16:38,540 --> 00:16:39,620
If you die,

284
00:16:39,720 --> 00:16:41,140
who will seek justice for your sister?

285
00:16:44,010 --> 00:16:45,930
The Cishan Foundation
will do everything it can

286
00:16:45,980 --> 00:16:47,570
to support Mr. Yoshida's
generous gesture

287
00:16:47,590 --> 00:16:50,270
and help Miss Mei arrange

288
00:16:50,570 --> 00:16:52,640
her sister's funeral.

289
00:16:52,940 --> 00:16:55,740
We're grateful for the Kun Society's

290
00:16:56,180 --> 00:16:57,100
willingness to help.

291
00:16:57,260 --> 00:16:58,860
You're very kind, Mr. Yoshida.

292
00:17:03,260 --> 00:17:05,580
Miss Mei, then it's settled.

293
00:17:08,220 --> 00:17:09,270
Then I have one condition.

294
00:17:10,860 --> 00:17:12,220
At my sister's funeral,

295
00:17:12,860 --> 00:17:14,420
that man must not be present!

296
00:17:20,420 --> 00:17:22,260
Boss Lv must be very busy.

297
00:17:22,420 --> 00:17:23,780
I'm sure he won't have time to attend.

298
00:17:24,620 --> 00:17:25,420
Enough.

299
00:17:25,570 --> 00:17:27,460
Today's matter ends here.

300
00:17:28,400 --> 00:17:31,440
♪And watch the lights
come on one by one♪

301
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:34,840
♪Like blades cutting
through the radiance♪

302
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:38,320
♪You may treat me as dust
beneath your feet♪

303
00:17:38,320 --> 00:17:40,240
♪Or wipe me away like ashes♪

304
00:17:40,240 --> 00:17:41,800
♪Leaving a cold ending♪

305
00:17:41,800 --> 00:17:43,760
♪But I refuse to fall♪

306
00:17:43,760 --> 00:17:48,680
♪I refuse to become a shadow
fading beneath the lights♪

307
00:17:48,800 --> 00:17:51,240
♪I refuse to dissolve into♪

308
00:17:52,320 --> 00:17:55,320
♪The lifeless light of the past♪

309
00:17:55,640 --> 00:17:58,480
♪I want sharpness at my fingertips♪

310
00:17:58,520 --> 00:18:01,320
♪And steps that avoid
the traps among the thorns♪

311
00:18:02,040 --> 00:18:04,920
♪At dawn, I will look
straight into your eyes♪

312
00:18:04,920 --> 00:18:08,120
♪My gaze clear, illuminating the dawn♪

313
00:18:09,600 --> 00:18:12,360
♪Those who have hurt me♪

314
00:18:12,920 --> 00:18:15,600
♪I choose to pierce through♪

315
00:18:17,200 --> 00:18:18,680
♪To tear apart♪

316
00:18:18,800 --> 00:18:24,680
♪To ignite a sacred flame♪

317
00:18:26,360 --> 00:18:28,480
♪I do not pray to the gods♪

318
00:18:28,480 --> 00:18:31,400
♪Nor bow to power♪

319
00:18:31,400 --> 00:18:33,680
♪I will no longer play the tragic lead♪

320
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:39,400
♪I will stand and carve
the path of my own fate♪
